      "introduction": "全章共 483 小节（谐谑曲 195 小节 + 慢速 Trio 93 小节 + 谐谑曲 Da Capo 195 小节，细分 27 个总谱节点，每约 30 秒一级导听）。布鲁克纳在此首次将谐谑曲置于第二乐章：外围是奥地利巨人农民「德意志米歇尔」拔山超海的五度重踏与小提琴震音旋风；中央的慢速 Trio（Langsam）则突然转入降 A 大调、E 大调与降 D 大调的世外桃源，三把竖琴如水银泻地般烘托着维也纳爱乐圆号与瓦格纳大号的神圣祈祷。",
      "introduction_en": "Spanning 483 bars across 27 score-aligned stages (~30s per block), Movement II frames a serene 2/4 Trio between two granite 3/4 Scherzo outer wings. 'Der deutsche Michel' stamps in C minor beneath whirling violin tremolos, while the Trio unveils three cascading harps and Vienna Philharmonic Wagner tubas in E major and D-flat major.",
      "mission": "首次聆听核心任务：在谐谑曲中把耳朵分成「上面呼啸的山风（小提琴）」与「下面砸地的铁靴（大提琴）」；进入 Trio（04:47）后捕捉三把竖琴破晓登场的绝美瞬间（05:48）。",
      "mission_en": "First-Listen Mission: Separate the whirling violin wind from the stamping cello bootsteps in the Scherzo; then catch the radiant debut of the three harps in the Trio at Letter B (05:48).",
      "next": "巨人的狂舞在雷霆一击中收束；点击进入第三乐章，迈入人类交响史上最崇高的降 D 大调慢板大教堂！",
      "next_en": "The giant's dance slams shut in granite unison; enter Movement III to step inside the sublime D-flat major Adagio cathedral!",
