      "id": 3,
      "roman": "III",
      "title": "庄严缓慢的柔板（Adagio）：天国拱门、瓦格纳大号与银河三钹绝顶",
      "title_en": "Adagio (Feierlich langsam): Heaven's Gate, Wagner Tubas & Cosmic Summit",
      "shortEn": "Adagio: Feierlich langsam",
